{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112522","id":2990224743,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6yOzVn","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112522","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112522.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112522.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112522","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112522/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112522/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112522/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/cf1452b7054ebb746aa6d74c664aea1caaeada9f","number":112522,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix VoxelGI rendering outside of non-uniform bounds","user":{"login":"Robert-K","id":34353377,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MzUzMzc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34353377?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K","html_url":"https://github.com/Robert-K","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Robert-K/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #62930 \r\n\r\n### Before:\r\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1009\" alt=\"editor_screenshot_2025-11-07T192310\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/78d4130a-a4b5-44be-bc53-ac4efd79e8b2\" />\r\n\r\n### After:\r\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1009\" alt=\"editor_screenshot_2025-11-07T222631\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/359e1634-8056-4d27-b018-3268dff85e37\" />\r\n\r\n#### What was the problem?\r\n\r\nThe GPU receives the VoxelGI transform in cell space for quicker tracing.\r\nThe bounds need to be in cell space, too, so the octree_size was passed.\r\nThat's incorrect, since for non-uniform bounds, it doesn't match the actual bounds in cell space.\r\n\r\nInstead, we scale the bounds using the basis of the to_cell transform and pass that.\r\nWe still have to map back to world units, hence we need to pass the octree_size as well (one could also pass the cell size (1.0/octree_size) instead for further optimization)...\r\nConveniently, a vec3 already existed as padding in the VoxelGIData struct passed to the GPU, so I just turned that into the octree_size.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/lab